  "notes": "stage 3 pot side force of mg90-d on dev-v006-2A-D. Three closed-loop Position mode clips kept as found data (plumb-1, holds-1, arm-1, the arm of 20 quarters hanging from the horn), the pot against the horn tag (image reading against the reference tag), plus stage 3 pot-table's free-horn crawl stalls. r = pos less stage 3's table at the tag angle mapped into its frame (sign x image_deg + offset). plumb_*: one alignment shift by the 8-20 Hz band, harmonics of each hold's last part (first 0.5 s out) as a line plus 5 harmonics of the camera's f0, each series on its own clock; *_crest without the window term. holds_*: last 0.5 s of each hold, beyond = the horn past the pot away from the plumb. arm_*: 3 Hz low pass, plumb holds and each segment's first 0.2 s out, gravity sin(theta - theta_g) from the crawls' current, bounds the 0.5 s block bootstrap sd; the gravity term and the camera scale are degenerate (arm_b_at_scale). free_*: stalled hold end less coast end, through the origin, se bounds. per_torque: deg/A over the stall Kt through the gears and Ke x N. Ranges are min and max over the holds unless the unit says otherwise.",
